{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>And Bethel sent</b> — The name of a prince, from the princes of Israel who were in Babylon. Similarly, <b>Sharezer and Regem-Melech</b> — names of princes. And the witness and his men are the men of Regem-Melech. Yefet said: it is like <b>the princes of Judah; great Regemoth</b>."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:46:12.405443165Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}